Index dashboard and document notes for global search.

Notes now live in their own vector collection, get re-embedded when created,
updated or deleted, and appear alongside documents in the global search
results. The search panel shows a note badge and navigates dashboard hits to
the board and document hits to the file's notes panel.

Generated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)

